    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "024F7E020AA59F9B",
      "text": "Ich habe gehört, dass du Champ der\\nBlaubeer-Liga geworden bist?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "024F7D020AA59DE8",
      "text": "Das ist fantastisch! Ich muss schon sagen,\\ndich zu uns zu holen war eine meiner\\r\\nbrillanteren Ideen.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "024F84020AA5A9CD",
      "text": "Da du jetzt schon eine Weile bei uns bist,\\nhätte ich eine Frage an dich.\\c\\nWie gefällt es dir hier? Hast du Spaß an der\\nBlaubeer-Akademie?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_01",
      "hash64": "FF16CF5FB1524138",
      "text": "Ja! Und wie!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_02",
      "hash64": "FF16D25FB1524651",
      "text": "Es geht...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "024F83020AA5A81A",
      "text": "Freut mich zu hören![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "024F82020AA5A667",
      "text": "„Es geht“...? Du meinst wohl, es geht nichts über\\ndas Leben hier![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "024F81020AA5A4B4",
      "text": "Ich weiß, das kommt jetzt etwas überraschend,\\naber ich möchte dich um einen Gefallen bitten,\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "024F78020AA59569",
      "text": "Dank dir geht es hier an der Blaubeer-Akademie\\nsehr viel lebhafter zu.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "024F77020AA593B6",
      "text": "Deswegen möchte ich ab jetzt noch aktiver Leute\\naus Paldea als [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Mentoren[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] zu uns holen.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "024BFA020AA28978",
      "text": "Du wirkst wie jemand, der überall bekannt ist.\\nUnd viele Freunde hast du doch bestimmt auch.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "024BFB020AA28B2B",
      "text": "Könntest du dich vielleicht bei Arenaleitern,\\ndeinen Lehrern oder starken Freunden umhören\\r\\nund sie zu uns einladen?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_03",
      "hash64": "FF16D15FB152449E",
      "text": "Überlassen Sie das mir!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_04",
      "hash64": "FF16D45FB15249B7",
      "text": "Hm...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "024BFC020AA28CDE",
      "text": "Ich wusste es, Champ! Auf dich ist eben Verlass![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "024BFD020AA28E91",
      "text": "Du denkst schon darüber nach, wen du zu uns\\nrufen sollst, was? Ich wusste, auf dich ist Verlass![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "024BFE020AA29044",
      "text": "Über den Computer hier im Raum kannst du\\nLeute, die du einladen willst, kontaktieren.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_system_01",
      "hash64": "A020FDE452B989BB",
      "text": "Um ihre Reisekosten und sonstigen Ausgaben\\nzu decken, sind jedoch BP nötig. Hier hast du\\r\\ngleich mal welche![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "024BFF020AA291F7",
      "text": "Du erhältst 200 BP von Direktor Cyano!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "024C00020AA293AA",
      "text": "Die als Mentoren eingeladenen Leute können\\nwährend ihres Besuchs diesen Raum für Pausen\\r\\nnutzen.\\c\\nDu kannst also bei Gelegenheit vorbeischauen\\nund ein bisschen mit ihnen plaudern.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_17",
      "hash64": "024C01020AA2955D",
      "text": "Also dann, alles Weitere überlasse ich dir.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
